    "E01C1/00": {
      "code": "E01C1/00",
      "level": 7,
      "parent": null,
      "ja": "道路の設計またはレイアウト，例．騒音軽減のための，ガス吸収のための（競技場の設計またはレイアウトＡ６３Ｃ１９／００；飛行場の設計またはレイアウトＢ６４Ｆ　｛ヘリコプタの着陸台用Ｅ０１Ｆ３／００｝）",
      "en": "Design or layout of roads, e.g. for noise abatement, for gas absorption (design or layout of sports grounds A63C19/00; design or layout of airfields B64F{, of helicopter landing stages E01F3/00})",
      "count": 419,
      "ipcCode": "E01C1/00",
      "coreCode": "E01C1/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_E01C.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "E01C1/002": {
      "code": "E01C1/002",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "E01C1/00",
      "ja": "｛道路の設計またはレイアウト，例．街路系統，断面形状（Ｅ０１Ｃ１／００５，Ｅ０１Ｃ１／００７が優先；　人道，歩道，犬走（バーム），硬路肩，自転車道Ｅ０１Ｃ１５／００）；　騒音を軽減する設計，　例．沈設した道路（建物によって生じる騒音の伝播の低減用Ｅ０１Ｃ３／０６；吸収性表面材の配設については各表面材のグループ参照；他の空気伝播による道路騒音の吸収用または反射用の装置，例．障壁Ｅ０１Ｆ８／００）｝",
      "en": "{Design or lay-out of roads, e.g. street systems, cross-sections (E01C1/005, E01C1/007 take precedence; of footpaths, sidewalks, berms, hard shoulders or cycle tracks E01C15/00); Design for noise abatement, e.g. sunken road (reducing transmission of structure-born noise E01C3/06; arrangements for absorbing or reflecting air transmitted road traffic noise, e.g. barriers E01F8/00)}",
      "count": 1790,
      "ipcCode": "E01C1/00",
      "coreCode": "E01C1/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_E01C.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "E01C1/005": {
      "code": "E01C1/005",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "E01C1/00",
      "ja": "｛排気ガスの除去または無毒化用に道路に常設される手段（集中吸気システムを用いて排気ガスを収集するもの，例．ワークショップまたはトンネル内においてＢ０８Ｂ１５／００２）｝",
      "en": "{Means permanently installed along the road for removing or neutralising exhaust gases (collecting exhaust gases with central suction systems, e.g. in workshops or tunnels, B08B15/002)}",
      "count": 175,
      "ipcCode": "E01C1/00",
      "coreCode": "E01C1/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_E01C.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "E01C1/007": {
      "code": "E01C1/007",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "E01C1/00",
      "ja": "｛運転者に減速または注意を喚起する設計または補助構造，例．ねじれた車道；高速通行または不在通行を阻止する装置（減速させるまたは拘束する表面材Ｅ０１Ｃ９／００７；減速または必要な警告を強化するための路面構造または路面装置，例．速度制御用路峰Ｅ０１Ｆ９／０４７）｝",
      "en": "{Design or auxiliary structures for compelling drivers to slow down or to proceed with caution, e.g. tortuous carriageway; Arrangements for discouraging high-speed or non-resident traffic (decelerating or arresting surfacings E01C9/007; road surface configurating or surface arrangements for enforcing reduced speed or required caution, e.g. speed-control humps E01F9/529)}",
      "count": 141,
      "ipcCode": "E01C1/00",
      "coreCode": "E01C1/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_E01C.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
