      "ja": "粒状または粉状物質，例．砂，砂利，塩，乾燥した結合材，の散布装置，例．拡散装置　（｛Ｅ０１Ｃ１９／２１，　Ｅ０１Ｃ１９／４８１３，　Ｅ０１Ｃ１９／４８２，　Ｅ０１Ｃ２３／０９８，　Ｅ０１Ｃ２３／１６６が優先；｝℃料散布機Ａ０１Ｃ１５／００；　｛砂利添加用または材料解凍用の常設された装置Ｅ０１Ｈ１０／００５；冬季の道路を処理するのに特に適合する移動散布機Ｅ０１Ｈ１０／００７｝）",
      "en": "Apparatus for distributing, e.g. spreading, granular or pulverulent materials, e.g. sand, gravel, salt, dry binders ({E01C19/21, E01C19/4813, E01C19/482, E01C23/098, E01C23/166 take precedence; } fertiliser distributors A01C15/00{; permanently-installed devices for applying gritting or thawing materials E01H10/005; mobile spreaders specially adapted for treating wintry roads E01H10/007})",
      "count": 430,
