      "level": 10,
      "parent": "E01C19/23",
      "ja": "加振されたローラまたは衝撃を受けたローラ，例．つち打ち打撃　（｛Ｅ０１Ｃ１９／２３５，｝　Ｅ０１Ｃ１９／２９，　｛Ｅ０１Ｃ１９／４１｝　が優先；　[Ｎ:非振動性弾性変形可能な転圧部材　Ｅ０１Ｃ１９／２３３]）",
      "en": "Vibrated rollers or rollers subjected to impacts, e.g. hammering blows ({E01C19/235, }E01C19/29, {E01C19/41} take precedence; {combined with non-vibrated elastically-deformable rolling elements E01C19/233})",
