      "en": "Devices or arrangements for working the finished surface (working freshly laid paving E01C19/42&#160;-&#160;E01C19/44, E01C23/02; mining picks E21C35/18); Devices for repairing {or reconditioning} the surface of damaged paving; {Recycling in place or on the road}",
