      "en": "{for forming, opening-out, cleaning, drying or heating cuts, grooves, recesses or, excluding forming, cracks, e.g. cleaning by sand-blasting or air-jet (E01C23/096, E01C23/0993 take precedence, save for E01C23/0946); for trimming paving edges}",
