      "level": 9,
      "parent": "E01F13/02",
      "ja": "｛固設された基板部分を有する撤去可能な障壁，例．臨時通路を設けるためのもの（Ｅ０１Ｆ１３／０２８，　Ｅ０１Ｆ１５／１２　が優先）｝　",
      "en": "{Removable barriers with permanently installed base members, e.g. to provide occasional passage (E01F13/028, E01F15/12 take precedence)}",
      "count": 186,
      "ipcCode": "E01F13/02",
