      "level": 8,
      "parent": "E01H1/00",
      "ja": "無用物の水力によるゆるめまたは除去（定置式噴射装置Ｅ０１Ｈ３／０４）；かき集めまたはそり落し装置（手道具Ｅ０１Ｈ１／１２）；｛液体または半流動体の除去，例．吸水，泥の滑り落とし（空気圧による除去Ｅ０１Ｈ１／０８；蒸気清浄Ｅ０１Ｈ１１／００）｝",
      "en": "Hydraulically loosening or dislodging undesirable matter (stationary flushing devices E01H3/04); Raking or scraping apparatus (hand implements E01H1/12){; Removing liquids or semi-liquids e.g., absorbing water, sliding-off mud (removing pneumatically E01H1/08; steam-cleaning E01H11/00)}",
