      "code": "E01H1/101",
      "level": 9,
      "parent": "E01H1/10",
      "ja": "｛水力によるゆるめまたは除去，機械的ゆるめまたは除去と組み合わせたものまたは組み合わせないもの，例．ブラシまたはワイパー付き道路洗浄機（Ｅ０１Ｈ１／００５が優先；線路の清掃Ｅ０１Ｈ８／１０５，Ｅ０１Ｈ８／１２５；液体の適用一般Ｅ０１Ｈ３／００；床または類似表面用こすり機Ａ４７Ｌ１１／２６～Ａ４７Ｌ１１／３０）｝",
      "en": "{Hydraulic loosening or dislodging, combined or not with mechanical loosening or dislodging, e.g. road washing machines with brushes or wipers (E01H1/005 takes precedence; cleaning rails E01H8/105, E01H8/125; applying liquids in general E01H3/00; scrubbing machines for floors or similar surfaces A47L11/26&#160;-&#160;A47L11/30)}",
