      "parent": null,
      "ja": "無用物の除去｛または微小物体｝鉄道軌道からのもの｛（植生の管理Ｅ０１Ｈ１１／００；レールまたは枕木からの砂利の除去Ｅ０１Ｂ２７／０２３；砂利それ自体の除去，清掃Ｅ０１Ｂ２７／０４，Ｅ０１Ｂ２７／０６）｝；路面軌道レールからの無用物の除去（Ｅ０１Ｈ１／００～Ｅ０１Ｈ６／００が優先）",
      "en": "Removing undesirable matter from the permanent way of railways; Removing undesirable matter from tramway rails (E01H1/00&#160;-&#160;E01H6/00 take precedence; {controlling vegetation E01H11/00; removing ballast from rails or sleepers E01B27/023; removing, cleaning the ballast itself E01B27/04, E01B27/06})",
