    "E04C5/00": {
      "code": "E04C5/00",
      "level": 7,
      "parent": null,
      "ja": "補強要素，例．コンクリートのためのもの；そのための補助要素（｛補強材を製造するための方法または装置　Ｂ２１Ｄ｝；　材料の組成　｛Ｃ０４Ｂ｝，Ｃ２１，Ｃ２２；　補強要素の配列は関連サブクラス参照）　[Ｎ:注．１．このグループにおいては，下記の用語は以下に示す意味で用いる:補強とは，最終製品のいかなる物理的強度特性，例．　圧縮または曲げ強度，をも向上させることを意味する；要素には，形態を問わない比較的小さな個別体，例．ガラス繊維，も比較的大きな物体，例．鋼棒，も含まれる。２．補強された建築要素と比較して小さく，組成のみに特徴がある個別補強要素はＣ０４Ｂに分類する，例．鋼繊維Ｃ０４Ｂ１４／４８，粒状または繊維状以外の形状を有する可塑性要素Ｃ０４Ｂ１６／１２]",
      "en": "Reinforcing elements, e.g. for concrete; Auxiliary elements therefor ({methods or devices for making reinforcing materials B21D;} material composition {C04B,}C21, C22)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this group, the following terms or expressions are used with the meanings indicated: <br>\"reinforcing\" means increasing any physical strength characteristic of the end product, e.g. compressive or flexural strength; <br>\"elements\" includes relatively large bodies, e.g. steel bars, as well as relatively small discrete bodies of any form, e.g. glass fibres.<br>Discrete reinforcing elements, which are small compared with the reinforced building element, only characterised by their composition are classified in C04B, e.g. steel fibres C04B14/48, plastic elements with a shape other than granular or fibrous C04B16/12",
      "count": 357,
      "ipcCode": "E04C5/00",
      "coreCode": "E04C5/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_E04C.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
