      "ja": "被覆またはライニング，例．壁面や天井に対するもの（床Ｅ０４Ｆ１５／００；表面の装飾，モザイク作業Ｂ４４，例．経師工事Ｂ４４Ｃ７／００；ウェブ製，例．織物または壁紙で造られたものＤ０３Ｄ，Ｄ０４Ｇ，Ｄ０４Ｈ，Ｄ０６Ｎ，Ｄ２１Ｈ；天井構造Ｅ０４Ｂ９／００；降水に対する屋根材または類似の防水被覆材Ｅ０４Ｄ）",
      "en": "Coverings or linings, e.g. for walls or ceilings (flooring E04F15/00; decoration of surfaces, mosaic work B44, e.g. paper-hanging B44C7/00; made of webs, e.g. of fabrics or wallpaper {, as such, or their manufacturing}D03D, D04G, D04H, D06N, D21H; construction of {false} ceilings E04B9/00; roofings or similar water-tight coverings against precipitation E04D)",
