    "E05B17/20": {
      "code": "E05B17/20",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "E05B17/00",
      "ja": "鎖錠機構とは独立した手段，　｛すなわち．タンブラまたはデテントとは別のもの｝無断開錠を防止するためのもの，例．ボルトを固着位置に固定するためのもの（ピンまたはデテント　Ｅ０５Ｂ１５／１２(ＥＣＬＡ)；　｛Ｅ０５Ｂ６３／１２が優先；Ｅ０５Ｂ１７／２０８４，Ｅ０５Ｂ６５／００８２も参照｝）",
      "en": "Means independent of the locking mechanism for preventing unauthorised opening, e.g. for securing the bolt in the fastening position {(locks with means carried by the bolt for interlocking with the keeper E05B63/12)}",
      "count": 602,
      "ipcCode": "E05B17/20",
      "coreCode": "E05B17/20",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_E05B.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
